# A firewall change, loaded by scripts/fault.sh 3: "CHG-0042, block web traffic to the old server 10.26.2.200".
# It was written for one address, but typed with the whole subnet. Inserted at the TOP of the forward chain.
insert rule inet fw forward ip daddr 10.26.2.0/24 tcp dport 80 counter drop comment "CHG-0042 block old web server"
